My usual path is:

1. Search dlvl 1-5 for shops.
2. Turn around and head to minetown.  Try to acquire two good pets.
3. Go back up and do sokoban.
4. Go back to the mine end, look for the good gray stone
5. Find and complete ludios
6. buy protection, if I had not already done the racket.
7. do Quest

I have learned over time to be patient.  If I need to traverse 25
levels to get back to my stash for something, no big deal.  There is no
time limit in this game.



